stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Open
    Open --> ClosingWindow
    ClosingWindow --> Extended: soft close bid in window
    Extended --> ClosingWindow: extension active
    ClosingWindow --> HardCutoff
    HardCutoff --> CloseComputation
    CloseComputation --> Committed: closeCommitId
    CloseComputation --> Frozen: fraud/replay/lag issue
    Frozen --> Review
    Review --> Committed
    Committed --> Settlement
